---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact TechPilot AI" description="Contact TechPilot AI with feedback, corrections, and topic suggestions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h1>Let's make tech <span style="color:var(--mint)">more useful.</span></h1><p>We welcome thoughtful feedback, correction requests, and ideas for future guides.</p></section>
  <section class="contact-box"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Send us a message</h2><p>This site is being set up. A dedicated contact email will be published here before launch. In the meantime, please check back soon.</p><p>For corrections, include the page title, the detail that needs updating, and a reliable source when possible.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
